      "message": "Toggling `collapseProofs`, `proofCollapseOverrides`, or `viewMode` does not clear `selectionActionBoxVisible`, `selectedSide`/`selectedLine`, or `hoveredLine`. Collapsing a proof while its lines are selected leaves `#selection-action-box` visible at stale coordinates and causes `createCommentFromSelectionOrHover()` (via `this.selectedSide !\u003d\u003d undefined` at line 1457, or sticky `hoveredLine` after clicking `.lean-proof-bar`) to create drafts on hidden proof lines (masked in `gr-diff-lean-viewer_test.ts:863` because `hasActiveSelection()` only checks live DOM range containment). Consider calling `this.hideSelectionActionBox(true)` and clearing `hoveredLine` when proof-collapse state or `viewMode` changes.",
