      "message": "Because all inline threads for a multi-line declaration card are stacked in `.threads-container` below the card (including threads on proof lines hidden when `collapseProofs` is enabled), leaving `showFilePath` as `false` on `\u003cgr-comment-thread\u003e` hides the `#\u003cline\u003e` label and makes proof comments indistinguishable from signature comments. Consider setting `.showFilePath\u003d${thread.line !\u003d\u003d undefined \u0026\u0026 thread.line !\u003d\u003d \u0027FILE\u0027}` (with `.showFileName\u003d${false}`) so `\u003cgr-comment-thread\u003e` renders the line number.",
