      "message": "Appending one line at a time (`combined +\u003d \u0027\\n\u0027 + lines[endRow]`) and re-running `findMatchingBracket(combined, 1)` from index 1 on each iteration is `O(N^2)` for a single unclosed `@[` attribute at the top of a file, and `O(N^3)` when multiple unclosed `@[` lines each rescan to EOF. Consider tracking bracket, string, and comment state incrementally in a single forward pass (and avoiding repeated scans to EOF when no closing `]` exists).",
