      "message": "Because `tokenizeLeanLine` is stateless across lines, lines 2..N of multi-line `/- ... -/` comment blocks (both standalone `comment` blocks at line 3540 and multi-line comments inside declaration bodies) are highlighted as executable Lean code. Prose such as `/-\\nAll proofs below use zero sorry or admit.\\n-/` renders red `.lean-tok-sorry` error pills inside a comment. Consider styling `comment` block lines directly as `comment` tokens and propagating block-comment depth across `signatureLines` and `bodyLines`.",
